# Markup+ Showcase

Welcome to the **complete feature demo** of `Markup+` — a modern markup language with more features than Markdown.

---

## 1. Text Formatting

This is **bold**, this is *italic*, and this is `inline code`.

You can combine them: **bold with *italic* inside**.

Special characters: `< > & " '` are escaped safely.

